          "report": "Score is 63.8/100 strict. Primary themes after reviewing all 84 issues:\n\n(1) Copy-paste proliferation [830ff984, 81932eae, 645e5374]: ensure_output_directory() duplicated identically 5+ modules; read_markdown_file() triplicated in 3 modules; find_markdown_files()/find_audio_files() structurally identical differing only in pattern list.\n\n(2) God files [1a0bfb3c, 8c1a9aa5]: html_website/main.py 400-line monolith embedding 185-line JS literal with silent bare except; legacy_import/main.py has ~80-line verbatim duplicate loop for full vs notes slides.\n\n(3) Error handling gaps [8c1a9aa5, cc-02, cc-04, 1a939d1a]: silent except in html_website, canvas_integration broad-except hides error contract, batch_render_lab_manuals returns partial results silently.\n\n(4) Type annotation gaps [d072d611, cc-01]: validate_outputs() annotates formats as List[str] but accepts None; systematic Optional omissions across 3 public validation functions.\n\n(5) Initialization coupling: setup_logging() called at module scope creating disk side effects on import.\n\n(6) API shape inconsistencies [0b4f08b4, 68df898b]: process_module_website arity deviation from sibling functions; sync_module_structure pure delegation adding no policy.\n\n(7) Dead code: markdown2 dependency declared but never used; unreachable else branch in publish/main.py.\n\nMost issues are genuine - the duplicate helper pattern and error-swallowing are confirmed by code reads. The sync_module_structure pure delegation [1bd51137] and trivial docstring bloat [5993a2f0] are lower priority.",
